<mj-text font-size="22px" line-height="30px" font-weight="bold" color="#0b0b0f">Account deletion scheduled</mj-text>
<mj-text>Hello {{name}},</mj-text>
<mj-text>We've received your request to delete your ilovelawyer account. You've been signed out, and your account and all associated data will be permanently deleted on {{scheduledFor}}, {{gracePeriodDays}} days from now.</mj-text>
<mj-text>Changed your mind? Just sign in before then and your account will be restored automatically.</mj-text>
<mj-text>If you didn't request this, sign in to cancel it, then change your password and contact support.</mj-text>
